# =============================================================================
# Neotree Data Pipeline -- .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This repository contains CODE, REFERENCE DICTIONARIES and DOCUMENTATION only.
# Patient-level data and credentials must NEVER be committed.
# =============================================================================

# --- Operating system junk ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# --- R session / project files -----------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron

# --- Pipeline run artifacts (regenerated on every run) -----------------------
cleaning_pipeline_R/output/
*.log

# --- Raw and processed patient data (NEVER COMMIT) ---------------------------
# Ignore EVERYTHING dropped into the pipeline input folder, whatever the file
# type, keeping only the placeholder that preserves the directory in git.
cleaning_pipeline_R/input/*
!cleaning_pipeline_R/input/.gitkeep

# NA-coded data extracts
*_na_coded.csv
*_na_coded.xlsx

# --- Data-key exports and script metadata (NEVER COMMIT) ---------------------
# Downloaded from the Neotree web editors; they contain the names of health
# workers.  Only the README of each folder is kept.
cleaning_pipeline_R/neotree_data_keys/*
!cleaning_pipeline_R/neotree_data_keys/README.md
cleaning_pipeline_R/neotree_scripts/*
!cleaning_pipeline_R/neotree_scripts/README.md
cleaning_pipeline_R/00_build_dictionary/private/

# --- Credentials / secrets (NEVER COMMIT) ------------------------------------
# A mirror address and token belong in a local copy of
# install_packages_mirror.r only -- the committed copy must keep the
# YOUR_MIRROR_ADDRESS_HERE and YOUR_TOKEN_HERE placeholders.
.env
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
